Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-t">Burst pipes, appliance failures and roof leaks, valued with drying, tear-out and matching included.</span><span class="pcard-go">Read more <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-and-umpire-services/fire-and-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 08</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-t">Structure, smoke, soot and contents valuation for kitchen fires, lightning strikes and total losses.</span><span class="pcard-go">Read more <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-and-umpire-services/tree-fall-and-ice-storm-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tree-on-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tree-on-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tree-on-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 09</span><h2>Fallen Tree &amp; Ice Storm Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-t">Tree strikes and ice-load failures valued with crane work, framing repair and debris-removal limits.</span><span class="pcard-go">Read more <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-and-umpire-services/historic-home-claim-appraisal/"><span class="pcard-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/historic-interior.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/historic-interior-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/historic-interior.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 10</span><h2>Historic Home Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="pcard-t">Plaster, heart pine, slate and old-growth trim valued at the real cost of like-kind repair.</span><span class="pcard-go">Read more <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-and-umpire-services/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="pcard-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-estimate.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-estimate-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-estimate.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 11</span><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><span class="pcard-t">A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate showing exactly what’s missing and what it’s worth.</span><span class="pcard-go">Read more <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/appraisal-and-umpire-services/umpire-selection-and-services/"><span class="pcard-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Service 12</span><h2>Umpire Selection &amp; Services</h2><span class="pcard-t">Neutral umpire work, plus help choosing a qualified umpire when the two appraisers can’t agree.</span><span class="pcard-go">Read more <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close at that stage.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/appraisal-and-umpire-services/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one part of the process?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and HOA claims?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes: offices, retail, churches, apartments, warehouses and condo or townhome associations.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only work storm claims?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We also value water, fire, smoke, lightning and tree claims, plus historic-home losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Carrier’s number and the repair bill don’t match?</h2><p>Send us the estimate. We’ll review it and tell you what we see, at no cost for the first look.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-accent" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/schedule-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
